      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A group of authors presents the rationale for local anesthesia selection in patients with concomitant disease based on case history; interaction analysis of drugs with local anesthetic and sedation agents; estimation of patient functional status; patient anxiety correction; dental care with hemodynamics monitoring. It was found that adhering to this algorithm promotes the prevention of urgent conditions in outpatient settings."},
